  "recordSet": [],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "apple-pi-full",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tApple-Pi (Full)\n\t\n\nFull release of the Apple-Pi physics benchmark: 400 cases (243 simulation + 157 realworld) for evaluating physics reasoning in image and video generation models.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tFolder structure\n\t\n\napple-pi-full/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 README.md\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 croissant.json\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 sim_subset/         # 243 simulation cases (10 physics tasks)\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 realworld_subset/   # 157 realworld cases (7 physics categories)\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tPer-case contents\n\t\n\nSimulation (sim_subset/<task>/<case_id>/) \u2014 generated with NVIDIA\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/AnonymousSubmitt/apple-pi-full.",
